From 1250dcf86bbd32f0cb331024417f9d1f518dc3ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "zhaoming.274" <zhaoming.274@bytedance.com>
Date: Mon, 25 May 2026 23:17:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Backport Botris mode and miscellaneous fork changes from
 upstream

Squash of 16 upstream commits (ce22afd..3060ec3) that bring in the Botris play mode and unrelated fork housekeeping. None of these touch the TetrisMap row bit semantics; that change is isolated in the next commit.

Upstream commits folded in (in author order):

- ce22afd Botris
- 42c1087 Botris 2
- 21e3a0d update ignore
- b42bc07 update ignore
- 9be64ca fix bug
- 7114fb8 Botris 3
- 1e052ca Botris 4
- c6d1944 Botris 5
- b489caf fix reset
- d43fba2 Botris 6
- adb429a Botris 7
- be16f12 - Add macOS to workflow file
- 6f86a6b Botris 8
- cd81bf2 Botris 9
- 3060ec3 Botris 10

New files: src/botris.cpp, src/cmd_tris.cpp, src/rule_botris.{h,cpp}, src/search_aspin.{h,cpp}.
Other changes: ai.cpp, ai_zzz.{h,cpp}, chash{,_map,_set}.h, sb_tree.h, tetris_core.{h,cpp} extensions for the Botris evaluator and search; CMakeLists, vcxproj, sln, gitignore housekeeping; macOS GitHub Actions job.

Co-Authored-By: Aime <aime@bytedance.com>
Change-Id: I8914f23a47a768a65fb227ff817bc6966a1ca35e
